  "scope": "Checkpoint batching and explicit diff-view disposal pass 679 tests in 67 files, types/build, all 215 native desktop checks with normal close and two newly executed corrupt-file startup cases. The actual delayed diff worker returns after native view closure without a runtime error; its original implementation reproduces the same Monaco error. The same 84 MB real-engine benchmark retains four exact owners/replies/statuses and twenty large messages while reducing final atomic updates from four to one and preserving the complete previous file. Original model/terminal completion deadlines and poll intervals are unchanged. Renderer bytes changed for explicit diff-view disposal; current comparison images are not claimed as individually reviewed. Fresh matching-body distribution, hosted acceptance and remaining full capability/UI scope remain open; precise earlier hosted timeout phase contributions are unestablished."
